{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20098","headline":"送萧链师入四明山 · 孟郊","name":"送萧链师入四明山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲於独鹤心，大於高松年。\n迥出万物表，高栖四明巅。\n千寻直裂峰，百尺倒泻泉。\n绦雪爲我饭，白云爲我田。\n静言不语俗，灵踪时步天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20098.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20098","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}